Lares (Artificer): P27 step 3 edits stand. Both requested typechecks passed (exit 0); git diff &#45;-check passed. No runtime test, build, browser runner, daemon, socket, vessel, git write or commit ran in this seat. The conductor retains runtime verdicts and commits. Prior steps' work remains; the worker-local CAS shortcut was deliberately replaced because it bypassed the new boundary.

Crossings and audience sources

* Node Repo: packages/lararium-node/src/self-slot-share.ts:122 — Structural branch proves in-process / fleet / contract / world; node composition passes the held floor.
* Browser Repo: packages/lararium-browser/src/open-browser-vessel.ts:2396 — Sibling proof -> fleet; relay without a gate -> fleet, gated relay -> world; other local peers -> in-process. Both hooks share one decision.
